    <guid isPermaLink="false">6846e81e6dbe9284e799f237</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Jun 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>韩剧《狂医魔徒》展现了一对拥有超强医术却又互相爱护、爱恨交织的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>师徒二人非常之像，但又各自有各自的疯批和癫狂。</span></p><span></span><p><span>故事从二人误会开始，到解开误会结束。</span></p><span></span><p><span>期间，朴恩斌饰演的徒弟郑世玉，一步步揭开自己的老师为何要那样对待自己，真相令人震惊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>而薛景求饰演的崔德熙也因为极度自恋一直暗中处理徒弟的一系列事情。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在剧中，师徒二人不仅医术顶尖救人无数，也为了某些不可告人的目的而杀人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听本期沙拉吧唧，一起感受疯批师徒CP在线斗法。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：特沙拉、阿荣</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzL2ExNTItYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy83MS85My9HS3dSSUpFTUhLaFZBQUVLaWdQRDNiZ3EuanBnIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ=="><span>郑世玉杀掉警监时的表情</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzL2MzNzktYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy8wNi9ENC9HS3dSSWFzTUhLaU1BQUdUWGdQRDNlNE0uanBnIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ=="><span>徒弟终于要为老师做手术了</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzLzdkMGQtYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy84NS84QS9HQXFobnRBTUhLaVRBQUZEbHdQRDNmUzQuanBnIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ=="><span>世纪大和解：一起犯罪一起傻笑</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzL2VhOGYtYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy85Ny9ERC9HQXFocUt3TUhLaWVBQ1pzVkFQRDNmX1UucG5nIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ=="><span>够邪性：“流氓”被杀之前的“斜”镜头</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzLzI5MWYtYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy80Ri9BOC9HS3dSSURvTUhLaXVBREh1bXdQRDNoRE4ucG5nIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ=="><span>我不理解你为什么那样对我</span></p><span><