  <item>
    <title>55.《大风杀》那些被困住的人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6835a59738dcc57c643b9d16</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6835a59738dcc57c643b9d16</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 May 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7">00:07</a> 2025年五一档《大风杀》的口碑两极分化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> 故事背景在西部一个封闭的地方，过往许多悬疑犯罪片在东北或重庆</span></p><span></span><p><span>犯罪团伙特征</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> 4个警察守着一座孤独的小城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="392">06:32</a> 耿乐饰演的曲马多，找到了郎月婷饰演的李红（辛柏青饰演的北山的女友）索要账本，而账本成了犯罪团伙内斗争夺的核心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="592">09:52</a> 曲马多想要推翻老大北山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="658">10:58</a> 张本煜饰演的会计，犯罪团伙内部的默契与幽默的镜头语言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> &nbsp;李感饰演的舌头，一直未露出真面目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">13:49</a> 白客饰演的夏然，警察对犯罪团伙的调查&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="928">15:28</a> 夏然“猫头鹰”外号的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1115">18:35</a> &nbsp;老大北山终于露面了（之前导演一直在拍他的脚）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1313">21:53</a> 牧羊小哥之死，简宁的夜盲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a> 犯罪团伙内斗：全员疯批</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1516">25:16</a> 酷似陈奕迅的辛柏青</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1878">31:18</a> 北山对会计心生嫌隙，猜疑链形成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2829">47:09</a> 北山疯魔与大风“杀”的到来（也是被吐槽比较多的地方）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3063">51:03</a> 大风杀过后的情境以及最后的幻象：卓杰泽仁饰演的多杰还活着吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3467">57:47</a> 镜头美学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3491">58:11</a> 会计之死和白客成功塑造的人物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3583">59:43</a> 这部电影对为数不多的女性角色拍得很好，没有沦落为花瓶、男人的附属、恋爱脑、边缘化和工具人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3792">63:12</a> 英文片名：被困住的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3824">63:44</a> 票房有些可惜，票房号召力：白客……异人之下乌尔善</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3878">64:38</a> 水饺皇后、马丽、中国合伙人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4194">69:54</a> 喜欢电影的风格、实景实拍、用心做电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4297">71:37</a> 北京电影节提前宣传，宣发的精彩镜头（刺激、血腥）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4469">74:29</a> 西部风格的犯罪题材影视：电影西风烈、无人区，电视剧沙尘暴&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65682a5ee1c033831a07bba5/lplj8XlRLDc_eXNMpcQGlymh7lwj.m4a" length="74293230" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs9uc47e8gwH1-8wCjlMxiyqFCCk.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>55</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
