  <item>
    <title>51.《幸福伽菜子的快乐杀手生活》谁要做拼尽全力还处处被欺负的普通人啊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6819c9676970cc7b4ded7c8f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6819c9676970cc7b4ded7c8f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 May 2025 03:07:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《幸福伽菜子的快乐杀手生活》讲述曾被欺负的社畜女主，意外入职杀手公司，凭借职场练就的技能成杀手天才，执行任务时释放压力。剧中女主内心戏有约十三种动物，充满笑点与对职场的讽刺，共六集，轻松搞笑。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 你有没有过类似的社畜经历？在职场被欺负、找工作屡屡碰壁、去很多不像公司的地方面试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="313">05:13</a> 杀手公司的福利比“正规”公司更好、更“合规”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">07:58</a> 第一单就是杀掉欺负自己的上司，这样的剧情不要太爽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">09:27</a> 第二个任务：不要给女生打分，会被杀掉的哦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="679">11:19</a> 职场小透明技能，在杀手行业派上用场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 职场练就的社畜苦逼技能之：任何事情都要在三秒内做完</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">15:15</a> 每天对日本贡献“极大价值”的电车猥琐男</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="974">16:14</a> 沉默寡言的前辈和突然开窍的西野伽菜子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 致命连连</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1097">18:17</a> 男警察和女警察</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1285">21:25</a> 江湖上已经有了杀手K的传说，愿意付双倍价钱的黑帮老大（后来成了女主闺蜜）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1546">25:46</a> 害羞的特效</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1692">28:12</a> 回到故乡的田园风</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1852">30:52</a> 小清新的治愈与杀手职业的反差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1943">32:23</a> 曾经杀“死”过无数次自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 我要杀掉你、我要娶你、我想做一个普通人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">35:05</a> 谁tm要拼尽全力还处处被欺负的普通人啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> 触发被动杀手技能、超高战力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2361">39:21</a> 社长不语，只是一味地烤肉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2428">40:28</a> 环境对内向的人的关怀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2787">46:27</a> 鱿鱼游戏同款“校服”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2936">48:56</a> &nbsp;主演能年玲奈的奋斗史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3025">50:25</a> 微笑代理公司</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3175">52:55</a> 走心、精神内耗、喜剧、体验生活的编剧</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65682a5ee1c033831a07bba5/lpQbkwe9GREcuCYoV-tLlen58hln.m4a" length="57510812" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv41xNiiqxAxeUFhCm5nxSsFsLDQ.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>51</itunes:episode>
