  <item>
    <title>44.《企鹅人》反派就是反派，主角也不能洗白</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677f9ca51962f0b75183f02e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677f9ca51962f0b75183f02e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Jan 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a> 《企鹅人》属于2022年《新蝙蝠侠》宇宙；此企鹅人与美剧《哥谭》中的企鹅人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1166">19:26</a> 评分最高的一集，法尔考的女儿索菲亚成长史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1799">29:59</a> 维克多的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> 索菲亚的逆袭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3176">52:56</a> 企鹅人奥兹的童年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3604">01:00:04</a> 企鹅人从政的隐喻，企鹅人与其他反派的不同：维护现有秩序，但王座上的人只能是企鹅人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4031">01:07:11</a> 主角是主角能开挂，但千万别忘了主角是反派，是坏蛋；PS反派刻画得越来越好，布鲁斯韦恩老爷被衬托得单薄了</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：《企鹅人》第二集片尾曲《Happy Together》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65682a5ee1c033831a07bba5/lvQpOqedjCUWNhQb9pF0GMbn73VC.m4a" length="76371256" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm4Ij7vdW-i457s5EeDIV0SaPqZl.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>44</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>43.剧版《百年孤独》终于直观地明白了什么是魔幻现实主义</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6776394915a5fd520e72d5bd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6776394915a5fd520e72d5bd</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Jan 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 小吐槽：网飞一次性上线一整季与付费超前点播</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">01:52</a> 影视化改编背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">06:31</a> 丽贝卡选角，真的是审美不一样吗；大儿子选角、乌尔苏拉选角、蕾梅黛丝……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="797">13:17</a> 完全贴合原著进行拍摄，剧情节奏紧凑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="921">15:21</a> 剧版拍出来魔幻现实主义了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1210">20:10</a> 多年以后，面对行刑队，奥里雷亚诺·布恩迪亚上校将会回想起父亲带他去见识冰块的那个遥远的下午。拉开了电视剧的帷幕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 百年孤独里的爱情阻碍重重却大多如愿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1376">22:56</a> 第一个魔幻，死去的人用手捂着流血的伤口站在布恩迪亚家里不肯离去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1935">32:15</a> 好家伙！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> &nbsp;吃土少女丽贝卡到来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a> 小透明大孙子出生了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2475">41:15</a> 魔幻名场面：马孔多集体感染失眠症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3210">53:30</a> 上校制作的小金鱼，在你想象中是什么样？和剧版的小金鱼一样吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3747">01:02:27</a> 第一代老何塞疯了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4538">01:15:38</a> 地震碰上了地震（本期封面图）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5540">01:32:20</a> 终于回到最开始的那句话了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5693">01:34:53</a> 找妈妈的血线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5760">01:36:00</a> 乌尔苏拉面对老何塞的墓碑说，我们最终还是生出了一个怪物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5823">01:37:03</a> 第一季结束；第四代梳理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6143">01:42:23</a> 语言、翻译也让我们感觉阅读《百年孤独》原著比较困难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6373">01:46:13</a> 网飞版《三体》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lohrcwiPSXj1dRrj0MR-TMGBB10S.m4a" length="105730958" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:48:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnI1v5S6zMOenV4tHN4atVTXz1Ta.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>43</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
